        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{21}{8}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P&=2\\frac{5}{8}\\\\P&=\\frac{2\\times8+5}{8}\\\\P&=\\frac{21}{8}\\end{align*}$$",
