        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{70}{16}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}4\\frac{3}{8}&=\\frac{4\\times8+3}{8}\\\\&=\\frac{35}{8}\\\\&=\\frac{70}{16}\\end{align*}$$",
